spans.s:
तडाक तडाक, अस्, m. (said to be fr. rt. तड्),
= तडाग, a pond or pool deep enough for the lotus;
(आ), f. a blow; a bank, a shore; splendor, lightning (?);
[cf. तटाक.]

ताड्यमान, अस्, आ, अम्, being beaten or struck;
suffering blows, undergoing a beating; (अस्), m. a
musical instrument which is struck (as a drum &c.).
